Package: xios-native
Name: Xios Desktop (Native iPadOS)
Version: 0.1.7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.5), xios-runtime (>= 0.1.4), xios-launcher-tools (>= 0.1.7), com.max.xiosprefs
MinimumOSVersion: 16.5.0
Description: the native iPadOS flavor for Xios
 Linux desktop apps as first-class iPadOS windows. This flavor installs no
 fullscreen Xios display app, desktop shell, or session launcher: each app gets
 its own Home Screen icon and its own iPadOS
 window, and Split View and Slide Over take the place of a desktop
 environment.
 .
 Installs the launcher sync tools, app-ID-only ioscd launch service, per-app host payload,
 and the Settings app pane used to choose which desktop apps appear on the
 Home Screen. App icons appear next to your iOS apps; tap one and the app
 opens like any other iPad app.
 .
 Needs iOS 16.5 or newer on a rootless jailbreak (/var/jb).
